    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert B2B outreach copywriter.\n\nCompany: {{ $json.company_name }}\nContact: {{ $json.contact_name }}\nResearch brief: {{ $json.research_brief }}\n\nWrite a cold email body made of a one-line greeting \"Hi <first name>,\" on its own line, followed by EXACTLY 4 sentences:\n1. Sentence 1: State the trigger (funding or hiring), using a specific fact taken from the research brief.\n2. Sentence 2: Bridge the trigger to a likely pain point.\n3. Sentence 3: Introduce our value proposition.\n4. Sentence 4: A low-friction call to action (e.g., \"Worth a 10-minute chat?\").\n\nRules:\n- Use only facts from the research brief. Do not invent numbers, names, or claims.\n- No buzzwords. Maximum 90 words after the greeting.\n- No signature, no square brackets, no placeholders.\n- Write a short, specific subject line (under 8 words).\n\nReturn the subject line and the body.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "fd468024-de45-47cf-b068-1026422105dc",
      "name": "Draft Email (LLM Chain)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        528,
